{"id":"653149","name":"花生小咸菜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/653149/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花生米","amount":"200g"},{"name":"酸菜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"子姜","amount":"2块"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花生米泡一晚上。","img":"images/653149/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉水入锅煮。","img":"images/653149/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盖上盖，煮15分钟。","img":"images/653149/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出备用。","img":"images/653149/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"子姜、酸菜、小米椒。","img":"images/653149/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"酸菜切丝，放清水中泡去咸味。","img":"images/653149/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"子姜切丝，小米椒切圈。","img":"images/653149/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"洗锅热油，把姜和小米椒炒出香气。","img":"images/653149/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入花生米。","img":"images/653149/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐、生抽和糖入味。","img":"images/653149/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入酸菜继续翻炒。","img":"images/653149/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"水分炒干，炒出香气即可。","img":"images/653149/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。美味小菜，拌饭佐粥极佳。","img":"images/653149/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}